<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Easco raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Easco raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Easco Inc was raised to a buy from a hold by CS First Boston on Wednesday, the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/4 to 6-1/2.</p>
<p>-- Earlier, the company said it named a new top executives, including a new president and chief executive post and a new chief financial officer. It said it expected a fourth quarter loss including charges for conpensation and severance payments.</p>
</text>
